 result←object New arg;parent;name;props;newobj;∆style;extent
 (parent name)←object ⍝ Separate non-standard two-part argument
 ∆style←arg ##._supp.GetInitialProps'style' ⍝ Obtain separate style bits (+1=Smooth, +2=Vertical)
 extent←(1+2∊∆style)⊃_supp.(_extentH _extentV) ⍝ Allow different default sizing based on orientation
 arg←(parent:parent ⋄ extent:extent)##.##.New.Center arg

 props←'ProgressBar'('Visible' 0) ⍝ Properties that must be used during creation
 props,←('Wrap' 1)('Thumb' 0)('Limits' 0 100)('Step' 10) ⍝ Default like APL+Win
 props,←⊂'ProgressStyle'('Normal' 'Smooth'⊃⍨1+1∊∆style)     ⍝? Create-only
 props,←⊂'Style'('Horz' 'Vert'⊃⍨1+2∊∆style)             ⍝? Create-only
 newobj←⎕VGET(parent⍕⍛,'.',name)##.##.∆WC props ⍝ Create the actual Dyalog object
 result←parent newobj ##.##.New.Initialize arg ⍝ Complete standard class-initialization procedure
